203
00:12:39,587 --> 00:12:41,908
Full Metal Alchemist

204
00:12:43,069 --> 00:12:45,150
Full Metal Alchemist

205
00:12:46,071 --> 00:12:47,711
可唔可以話畀我知啊？

206
00:12:48,112 --> 00:12:51,354
